WEBVTT

00:10:29.676 --> 00:10:36.676
(Applause)

00:10:38.076 --> 00:10:40.716
The farmers were overjoyed.

00:10:41.796 --> 00:10:44.596
So how do we know
that we're having impact?

00:10:44.596 --> 00:10:46.596
Nine moths after our Tree Lab,

00:10:46.636 --> 00:10:49.876
Asha went from having
zero tons per hectare

00:10:49.876 --> 00:10:51.916
to 40 tons per hectare.

00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:53.716
She had enough to feed her family

00:10:53.756 --> 00:10:56.436
and she was selling it at the market,

00:10:56.476 --> 00:10:59.196
and she's now building a house
for her family.